  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">St&#xf8;tte til NGO-deltagelse i Befolkningskommissionens 46. samling (CPD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant aims at financing the participation of CSO representatives at the 46th session of UN Commission on Population and Development held from 22th to 26th of April 2013 in New York. The theme of the CPD is: &quot;New Trends in Migration: Demographic Aspects&quot;. NGO-Forum, a central collaborator for Danish organisations with a focus on Danish development aid, will be in charge of the selection of CSOs that will participate in the session.</narrative>
  </description>
